<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chrysler reinstated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chrysler reinstated.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said analyst Nick Lobaccaro reinstated Chrysler Corp as a near- and long-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares opened up 3/8 to 32-1/8 on Monday.</p>
</text>
